Package: betterbiplot
Title: Better Looking Biplots in Base R
Version: 2.0.1
Authors@R: person("Benjamin", "Bell", email = "benbell01@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates customisable biplots for Principal Component Analysis (PCA)
    using only base R graphics. Supports 'prcomp()', 'princomp()', 'vegan::rda()',
    'survey::svyprcomp()', 'FactoMineR::PCA()', 'ade4::dudi.pca()', and
    'psych::principal()' objects as well as custom score and loading matrices,
    with support for grouping by colour, symbol, and size, covariance and
    Hotelling-t ellipses, convex hulls, centroids, spider lines, circles of
    equilibrium contribution, label rotation, and selective legends.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://benbell95.github.io/better_biplot/, https://github.com/benbell95/better_biplot
BugReports: https://github.com/benbell95/better_biplot/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    graphics,
    grDevices,
    stats
